        "explanation": "Using \\(\\\\lvert\\\\vec a+\\\\vec b\\\\rvert^2-\\\\lvert\\\\vec a-\\\\vec b\\\\rvert^2=4\\\\vec a\\\\cdot\\\\vec b\\), the equality implies \\(\\\\vec a\\\\cdot\\\\vec b=0\\). Hence the vectors are mutually perpendicular.",
