        "question_title": "For non-zero vectors \\(\\\\vec a\\) and \\(\\\\vec b\\), if \\(\\\\lvert\\\\vec a+\\\\vec b\\\\rvert>\\\\lvert\\\\vec a-\\\\vec b\\\\rvert\\), then the angle between \\(\\\\vec a\\) and \\(\\\\vec b\\) must be",
